# The production image build context is an allowlist (ADR-0044 s.6). Everything is
# excluded, then only what an image needs is admitted: the package source, the one
# task entrypoint, the packaging files and the git-ignored compiled-configuration
# staging directory. No tests, docs, infra, LEAN, logs, private runtime area, git
# metadata or workstation files can reach a build.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!src/**
!scripts/production_task_entrypoint.py
!docker/production/constraints.txt
!docker/production/entry/
!docker/production/entry/**
!docker/production/build/
!docker/production/build/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
